{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Divine's Howl, you will assume the role of an incarnation of a deity, leading your followers to expand divine power in a shattered world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every deck you build, every sacrifice you make, is a ritual leading to ultimate dominion. This is not just a card battle, but an immersive cosmic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We combine strategy with ritual to construct an unprecedented dark and mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/4246cb3c5cc15a43663167890a37bfd9.avif?t=1763274747\" width=1170 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can build structures to unlock various gameplay features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/c2250b34c199f95d9035af1cfaab3d10.poster.avif?t=1763274747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/c2250b34c199f95d9035af1cfaab3d10.webm?t=1763274747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/c2250b34c199f95d9035af1cfaab3d10.mp4?t=1763274747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building is the main way to obtain Apostle Cards, for example: having a baby?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/fc3616bbb72df79f42dbb0ad97ddda22.poster.avif?t=1763274747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/fc3616bbb72df79f42dbb0ad97ddda22.webm?t=1763274747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/fc3616bbb72df79f42dbb0ad97ddda22.mp4?t=1763274747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can complete experimental missions by dispatching apostles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing various building tasks will yield different asset rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example: Create a monster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/2314e9051702eec1d6b4ca999ec30718.poster.avif?t=1763274747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/2314e9051702eec1d6b4ca999ec30718.webm?t=1763274747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/2314e9051702eec1d6b4ca999ec30718.mp4?t=1763274747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brief introduction can't fully capture the game's gameplay and features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you've read this far, why not give it a try?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, the apostles we command each possess their own unique design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/efd6f00d0e7dcb19937066ac3a68cb86.avif?t=1763274747\" width=600 height=734 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794270/extras/c8a421eceda00b8b50b626035da0d0f3.avif?t=1763274747\" width=600 height=390 /></span><span cla